	quest.35105F4914FBEC3B.quest_subtitle: "充电器可以通过ME网络或手动曲柄为支持的工具充电。它还可以将Certus Quartz Crystal制成Charged Certus Quartz Crystal，或将Compass制成Meteorite Compass。"
